{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50157","headline":"咏史 · 刘知几","name":"咏史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泛泛水中蓱，离离岸傍草，逐浪高复下，从风起还倒。\n人生不若兹，处世安可保？\n遽瑗仕卫国，屈伸随世道；方朔隐汉朝，易农以爲宝。\n饮啄得其性，从容成寿考。\n南国有狂生，形容独枯槁，作赋刺椒兰，投江溺流潦。\n达人无不可，委军（运）推苍昊；何爲明白（自）销[一]，取讥於楚老？\n（[一]、王云：「『军』疑应作『运』『白』疑应作『自』，用《汉书·龚胜传》语。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘知几","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}